    "https://jobs.ferris.edu/en-us/job/498196/recreation-center-student-mngr-student-position": {
      "title": "Details - Recreation Center Student Mngr (Student Position)\n        - Ferris State University",
      "description": "Details - Recreation Center Student Mngr (Student Position)\n        - Ferris State University Recreation Center Student Mngr (Student Position) Apply now Job no: 498196 Work type: Student Employment - General Location: Big Rapids, MI 49307 Categories: Student Employment - General Position Title: University Recreation - Student Manager (Student Position) Location: Big Rapids, MI Department: Student Services Advertised Salary: $14.00 - $14.49 Summary of Position: The Student Manager for the Student Recreation Center is responsible for the overall operation of the recreational facility, ensuring a safe, inclusive, and engaging environment for all students, members, and guests. This position involves overseeing student staff, managing programming, providing excellent customer service, enforcing policies and procedures, and following risk management procedures. Position Requirements: Strong leadership and organizational skills. Excellent communication and interpersonal abilities. Ability to work independently and as part of a team. Ability to resolve conflict in a respectful manner. Previous experience in leading or supervising peers and or fellow workers. Must be able to work flexible hours including early mornings, evenings, and at least 1 weekend a month. As an individual who is handling money during your shift on behalf of the University, is required that Human Resources obtain your background check to determine your eligibility to handle money transactions. Essential Duties/Responsibilities: Ensure the facility is clean, safe, and inclusive for all students, members and guests. Help enforce all policies regarding students and members for entering and leaving the facility. Monitor and manage the use of recreational equipment and spaces. Help with programming throughout the facility when called upon. Open and close the cash register to the POS system each day. Responsible for closing the drawer each night and batching out all credit cards. Carryout all risk management procedures when needed. Supervise, mentor, and support all student staff during scheduled shift. Monitor staff responsibilities to ensure all tasks are being completed during shifts. Foster a positive work environment. Provide excellent customer service by addressing user inquiries and concerns promptly and professionally. Handle membership registrations and other administrative tasks related to user services. Manage user access and ensure compliance with facility policies and procedure Identify, troubleshoot, and resolve issues related to facility operations, staff performance, and customer satisfaction. Maintain accurate records of incidents and follow up as necessary. Number of Positions Available: 1 Documents Needed to Apply: Resume/ Class Schedule Job Close Date: September 6, 2026 EEO Statement: Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.  Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at ferris.edu . The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit: Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement . Advertised: 04 Sep 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: 06 Sep 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Closes Recreation Center Student Mngr (Student Position) Big Rapids, MI 49307 6 Sep 2026 The Student Manager for the Student Recreation Center is responsible for the overall operation of the recreational facility, ensuring a safe, inclusive, and engaging environment for all students, members, and guests. This position involves overseeing student staff, managing programming, providing excellent customer service, enforcing policies and procedures, and following risk management procedures. Expression of Interest Loading... Current Opportunities Position Location Closes Recreation Center Student Mngr (Student Position) Big Rapids, MI 49307 6 Sep 2026 The Student Manager for the Student Recreation Center is responsible for the overall operation of the recreational facility, ensuring a safe, inclusive, and engaging environment for all students, members, and guests. This position involves overseeing student staff, managing programming, providing excellent customer service, enforcing policies and procedures, and following risk management procedures. Powered by PageUp Returning Applicant? Login to complete your application and/or apply for more positions. Login Job Alerts We'll send you an email when a position becomes available that matches your search criteria Subscribe Job search e.g. \"Professor\", \"Administrator\" Refine search Work Type Student Employment - General 1 Locations Big Rapids, MI 49307 1 Categories Student Employment - General 1 RSS Copyright © Ferris State University"
