      "description": "Details - CAPS Clerical 1 (Student Position)\n        - Ferris State University CAPS Clerical 1 (Student Position) Apply now Job no: 498194 Work type: Student Employment - Work Study Only Location: Big Rapids, MI 49307 Categories: Student Employment - Work Study Only Position Title: CAPS Clerical 1 (Student Position) Location: Big Rapids, MI Department: CAPS Advertised Salary: $13.73-$13.99 Summary of Position: Want to get exposed to everything that Ferris State has to offer? Career and Professional Success! You will get to help out at many events across campus, create advertisements, and other clerical duties. Position Requirements: - Compassion and interest in working with students, faculty, staff, and employers - Some understanding of Ferris structures and resources - Attention to detail - Some technology proficiency with Microsoft products and Canva - Must have a 2.5 GPA - Must be able to pass a background check by the university Essential Duties/Responsibilities: - Participate in regular staff meetings - Assist professional staff with clerical tasks which may include: scheduling meetings, returning phone calls, answering emails, taking meeting minutes, purchasing items, and proofreading documents. - Assist at events - Create advertising posters - Advertise CAPS events - Provide feedback and suggestions for innovative changes - Plan, implement, and evaluate programming - Including but not limited to room reservations, catering reservations, advertising, supply purchases, cash handling, event set-up, staffing events, and finding and leading volunteers. - Other duties as assigned. Number of Positions Available: 2 Documents Needed to Apply: Resume/ Class Schedule Job Close Date: September 18, 2026 EEO Statement: Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers 