s:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;- Writing tutors must have experience tutoring students in research writing, documentation, grammar, style, and organization. &lt;br&gt;- Tutors must have completed the 300-level writing requirement and have a 3.0 GPA.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;Working with students on research writing, documentation, grammar, style, and organization.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule/ Portfolio&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please submit a sample of your Academic Writing (i.e. a paper for a composition class or another course).&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 18, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=498082&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sat, 19 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>C - VPAA</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498054</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498054</link><title>Intramural Official (Student Position)</title><description>Intramural Officials are responsible for officiating all intramural sports and special events offered by or sponsored by University Recreation. They oversee and manage a fun and safe atmosphere for all participants and assist the Intramural Supervisors when needed.</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-05T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>498054</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 230px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;University Recreation - Intramural Official (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 40px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 40px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;University Recreation Center&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 40px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73- $13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Intramural Officials are responsible for officiating all intramural sports and special events offered by or sponsored by University Recreation. They oversee and manage a fun and safe atmosphere for all participants and assist the Intramural Supervisors when needed.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Leadership and supervisory abilities&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of standard practices in recreational sports&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in an environment that values high expectations, accountability, and balanced lifestyles&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of intramural sports policies and rules&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;A desire to acquire knowledge of all intramural sports offered&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Good interpersonal skills and ability to relate with peers&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Assist in setting up equipment for activities.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Assist in the signing-in of participants and verifying eligibility. Assist in examining playing surfaces for safety hazards.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Enforce intramural policies and procedures during contests.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Assist in completing all shift forms that are required.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Assist in storing equipment at the conclusion of activities.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Assist in securing the facility at the conclusion of activities.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Evening and weekend work as required&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Required to attend all mandatory training clinics and staff meetings.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;18&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=498054&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - General</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>E - Student Affairs</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498055</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498055</link><title>Makerspace Helper (Student Position)</title><description>Assist students and faculty with design and fabrication projects, train users on 3D printers and laser equipment, and maintain makerspace tools and supplies to support hands-on learning.</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-05T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>498055</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 453px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Makerspace Helper (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;College of Engineering Technology&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$14.00&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Assist students and faculty with design and fabrication projects, train users on 3D printers and laser equipment, and maintain makerspace tools and supplies to support hands-on learning.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Type:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Student Employment - General&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ability to:&lt;br&gt;Operate and maintain 3D printers, laser cutters, and related equipment.&lt;br&gt;Follow and promote safety procedures while keeping machines in good working order.&lt;br&gt;Train and assist students and faculty in using makerspace tools.&lt;br&gt;Troubleshoot issues with equipment and projects as needed.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;Keep the makerspace running day to day and make sure equipment is ready to use.&lt;br&gt;Run and maintain 3D printers, laser cutters, and other tools.&lt;br&gt;Help students and faculty with their projects, from setup to troubleshooting.&lt;br&gt;Show people how to use the machines safely and correctly.&lt;br&gt;Keep track of supplies and let supervisors know when things are running low.&lt;br&gt;Make sure the space stays safe, clean, and organized.&lt;br&gt;Work with people from different programs and support a variety of projects.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;September 20, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=498055&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 03:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - General</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>C - VPAA</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498047</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498047</link><title>Dining Helper- Catering (Student Position)</title><description>The Dining Services Helper is a general student position that works within the dining areas.</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-04T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>498047</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 273px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Dining Services Helper Catering (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px; width: 72.561%\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;51- Aux&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73-$13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;The Dining Services Helper is a general student position that works within the dining areas.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 54px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 54px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 54px\"&gt;*As an individual who is responsible for driving on behalf of the university, a driving record check will be run pursuant to university policies. &amp;nbsp;The individual will be required to sign an authorization to run a criminal history background and driving record check.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 54px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Cooking&lt;br&gt;*Cleaning&lt;br&gt;*Stocking&lt;br&gt;*Serving guests&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Operates university motor vehicles safely to transport food/supplies.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume, Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 