td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;September 28, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=497982&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 03:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>C - VPAA</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497986</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497986</link><title>Education Clerical I (Student Position)</title><description>This position is office based and customer service oriented, as well as staff-support focused to maintain basic tasks and procedures for the office.</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:category><job:refNo>497986</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 253px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Education Clerical I (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;School of Education&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73-$13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;This position is office based and customer service oriented, as well as staff-support focused to maintain basic tasks and procedures for the office.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Good communication skills, customer oriented, previous office experience preferred, familiarity with Microsoft Office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;Duties include answering phones, data entry, filing, typing, photocopying, and customer service. Other duties may include assisting staff with various projects and tasks as needed.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=497986&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>C - VPAA</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497991</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497991</link><title>KCAD Flex Lab Asst (Student Position)</title><description>FlexLab student employees work directly with the Dow Center FlexLab Coordinator. Students will learn new skills and technologies on the job to facilitate the successful output of digital fabrication/design projects with the KCAD/FSU community. Weekly schedule will be decided based on the student's availability, the FlexLab's staffing needs, and open lab hours. Hours are somewhat flexible and work around the student's course schedule as it changes from semester to semester.</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>497991</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 236px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;KCAD FlexLab Assistant (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Grand Rapids, MI&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kendall College of Art and Design&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73- $13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;FlexLab student employees work directly with the Dow Center FlexLab Coordinator. Students will learn new skills and technologies on the job to facilitate the successful output of digital fabrication/design projects with the KCAD/FSU community. Weekly schedule will be decided based on the student's availability, the FlexLab's staffing needs, and open lab hours. Hours are somewhat flexible and work around the student's course schedule as it changes from semester to semester.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;*Must have retail or service industry experience&lt;br&gt;*Experience and working knowledge of Adobe Creative Cloud&lt;br&gt;*A willingness to learn on the job&lt;br&gt;*Experience with or interest to learn the use of 2D and 3D input and output devices&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;*Communicate effectively with the Coordinator and the KCAD/FSU Campus at large&lt;br&gt;*Track material and technology usage and supply prompt reporting&lt;br&gt;*Cash handling via cash, check, credit card&lt;br&gt;*Learn and teach FlexLab processes to FlexLab users&lt;br&gt;*Operate equipment including wide format inkjet printers, 3D scanners, 3D printers, vinyl cutters, and LASER cutters/engravers&lt;br&gt;*Learn and understand the pros and cons of each process&lt;br&gt;*Accurately record and calculate billing and usage data&lt;br&gt;*Projects as assigned by coordinator&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Cover Letter/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=497991&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Grand Rapids, MI 49503</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - General</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>C - VPAA</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497992</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497992</link><title>Golf Shop Assistant (Student Position)</title><description>Golf shop assistant will be helping in the shop and checking in guess with tee times. Working in the Pro Shop and Janke Learning center</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>497992</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 253px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Golf Shop Assistant (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Katke Golf Course&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Golf shop assistant will be helping in the shop and checking in guess with tee times. Working in the Pro Shop and Janke Learning center&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;- Prefer background and knowledge of retail operations and golf knowledge is beneficial.&lt;br&gt;- As an individual who is responsible for driving on behalf of the university, a driving record check will be run pursuant to university policies. &amp;nbsp;The individual will be required to sign an authorization to run a criminal history background and driving record check.&lt;br&gt;- Safe driving is mandatory at all times while operating a golf cart on the course.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Assisting with tournament operations&lt;br&gt;- Answering phone calls&lt;br&gt;- Assisting members and guests with tee times and check in upon arrival&lt;br&gt;- Receiving, restocking and displaying of merchandise,&lt;br&gt;- Cash handling and operating a point of sale system&lt;br&gt;- Setting up customers with Trackman bays&lt;br&gt;- Indoor and outdoor range ball coverage&lt;br&gt;- Maintaining organization and light cleaning of all areas.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Operates university motor vehicles, including golf carts, safely while carrying out job responsibilities.&lt;br&gt;- Staging carts in the morning and throughout the day. Taking carts from the barn to the staging area.&lt;br&gt;- Using carts to manage the course- Ranger duties, assist customers when needed&lt;br&gt;- Returning carts to the wash area and parking in the barn to recharge.&lt;br&gt;- Pick Balls from the range- Return balls to wash and fill the ball dispenser&lt;br&gt;- Set up course for events&lt;br&gt;- Driving golf carts on public roads is strictly prohibited.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;October 31, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=497992&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 03:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - General</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>D - Admin and Finance</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497993</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497993</link><title>Racquet Facility Clerical 1 (Student Position)</title><description>The Clerical General Level I position will consist of office work and will allow you to expand your knowledge in Microsoft programs and other general office duties.</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>497993</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 253px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Racquet Facility Clerical General Level I (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Student Services&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73- $13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;The Clerical General Level I position will consist of office work and will allow you to expand your knowledge in Microsoft programs and other general office duties.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;*Should have knowledge in Microsoft programs such as Word and Excel&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;*Answering phones, data entry, filing, typing, and photocopying&lt;br&gt;*Manual assembly&lt;br&gt;*Tours&lt;br&gt;*Assisting faculty and patrons&lt;br&gt;*Scheduling appointments&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=497993&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - Work Study Only</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>E - Student Affairs</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497998</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497998</link><title>Sports Medicine Aide (Student Position)</title><description>Do you have an interest in sports medicine? If so, this position may be your opportunity to experience what it is like to help care for injuries and assist the athletes by doing various tasks.</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>497998</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 253px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Sports Medicine Aide (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;50- Admin and Finance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73- $13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Do you have an interest in sports medicine? If so, this position may be your opportunity to experience what it is like to help care for injuries and assist the athletes by doing various tasks.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;*Must attend athletic practices and events&lt;br&gt;*Must have the ability to learn the skills necessary for health care to athletic teams&lt;br&gt;*Willing to work afternoons, evenings, and weekends as class schedule allows&lt;br&gt;*Responsibility, initiative, and dependability are essential&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;*Care for injuries, specifically wound care and first aid&lt;br&gt;*Set up first aid supplies, water, and ice for practices and events&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=497998&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - General</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>D - Admin and Finance</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497999</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/497999</link><title>Athletic Equipment Room Aid (Student Position)</title><description>Are you interested in assisting the equipment managers of different athletic teams? If so, this position may be your opportunity to gain experience in the field of athletic equipment.</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>497999</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 246px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Athletic Equipment Room Aid (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;50- Admin and Finance&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 10px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 10px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;$13.73-$13.99&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 10px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Are you interested in assisting the equipment managers of different athletic teams? If so, this position may be your opportunity to gain experience in the field of athletic equipment.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;*Requires some nights and weekends&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;*Assisting with equipment issues and repair&lt;br&gt;*Doing laundry&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume, Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&g