tion)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;50- Admin and Finance&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73-$13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Are you interested in working college athletic events? If so, this position may be your opportunity to explore the management side of game days.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;*Must be able to work some weekends and weekday afternoons&lt;br&gt;*Should be interested in hockey, men's and women's basketball, football, volleyball, and women's soccer&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;*Set-up/take down of event equipment&lt;br&gt;*Working in-game promotions/contests&lt;br&gt;*Selling programs&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume, Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=498000&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - General</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>D - Admin and Finance</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498001</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498001</link><title>Ice Arena Facility Supervisor (Student Position)</title><description>Have you been working at the ice arena and are interested in growing at the facility? If so, they are seeking out a facility supervisor.</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>498001</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 453px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ice Arena Facility Supervisor (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;50- Admin and Finance&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;$14.00 - $14.49&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Have you been working at the ice arena and are interested in growing at the facility? If so, they are seeking out a facility supervisor.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;*Handles all of the facility opening and closing duties&lt;br&gt;*Oversees and assists student staff at the pro shop, concessions, and maintenance&lt;br&gt;*Drive ice resurfacer&lt;br&gt;*Handle customer service issues&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"https://www.ferris.edu/HTMLS/administration/president/generalcounsel/pdfs-docs/00108985.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</job:description><job:applyLink>https://secure.dc4.pageuppeople.com/apply/1010/gateway/default.aspx?c=apply&amp;lJobID=498001&amp;lJobSourceTypeID=796&amp;sLanguage=en-us</job:applyLink><job:closingDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 04:55:00 GMT</job:closingDate><job:location>Big Rapids, MI 49307</job:location><job:workType>Student Employment - General</job:workType><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:subCategory></job:subCategory><job:businessLayer1>D - Admin and Finance</job:businessLayer1></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498002</guid><link>https://jobs.ferris.edu/cw/en-us/job/498002</link><title>Ice Arena Student Assistant (Student Position)</title><description>Are you interested in hockey or skating? If so, the ice arena is seeking student employees to help around the arena.</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 04:00:00 Z</pubDate><a10:updated>2026-08-01T04:00:00Z</a10:updated><job:category>Student Employment - General</job:category><job:refNo>498002</job:refNo><job:description>&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6673%; height: 253px\" border=\"1\"&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Athletics Ice Arena Student Assistant (Student Position)&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Big Rapids, MI 49307&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 46px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"height: 46px\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;50- Admin and Finance&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 46px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertised Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;$13.73- $13.99&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Are you interested in hockey or skating? If so, the ice arena is seeking student employees to help around the arena.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;*Preferred if you have knowledge in hockey/skating, and experience in cash handling&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;*Assisting in either pro shop, maintenance, concessions, or events&lt;br&gt;*Dealing with food preparation, cash handling, merchandising, cleaning, and staffing zones during events&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 35px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 35px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Positions Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 35px\"&gt;20&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 35px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documents Needed to Apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Resume/ Class Schedule&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 17px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 18px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 18px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Close Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 18px\"&gt;December 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 6.27132%; height: 18px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr style=\"height: 17px\"&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 27.439%; height: 17px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td style=\"width: 72.561%; height: 17px\"&gt;Ferris State University, an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to enhancing equity, inclusion, and diversity within its community. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence.&amp;nbsp; Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\"http://ferris.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"&gt;ferris.edu&lt;/a&gt;. The University actively seeks applications from women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, veterans, and other underrepresented groups. For 